<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Reserva confirmada - Villaggio Girotto</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f4f4; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
    .wrapper { width: 100%; background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 20px 0; }
    .email-container { width: 600px; max-width: 100%; background-color: #ffffff; margin: auto; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
    .header { padding: 24px; background-color: #315b3a; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }
    .content { padding: 28px; color: #263129; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; }
    .details-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; }
    .details-table td { padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #dddddd; vertical-align: top; }
    .cta-button { text-align: center; margin: 24px 0; }
    .cta-button a { display: inline-block; background-color: #315b3a; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold; }
    .footer { padding: 18px; background-color: #f4f4f4; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #777777; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <table class="wrapper" role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table class="email-container" role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
          <tr>
            <td class="header">
              <h1>Reserva confirmada</h1>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="content">
              <p>Olá <%= @reserva.guest_name.presence || @user.name %>,</p>
              <p>Recebemos seu pagamento e sua reserva foi confirmada no Villaggio Girotto.</p>

              <table class="details-table">
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>Código da reserva</strong></td>
                  <td>#<%= @reserva.id %></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>Cabana</strong></td>
                  <td><%= @reserva.cabana.guest_display_name %></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>Entrada</strong></td>
                  <td><%= @reserva.start_date.strftime("%d/%m/%Y") %></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>Saída</strong></td>
                  <td><%= @reserva.end_date.strftime("%d/%m/%Y") %></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>Diárias</strong></td>
                  <td><%= number_to_currency(@daily_total, unit: 'R$ ', separator: ',', delimiter: '.') %></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>Serviços contratados</strong></td>
                  <td>
                    <% if @service_email_items.any? %>
                      <ul>
                        <% @service_email_items.each do |service_item| %>
                          <li>
                            <%= service_item[:name] %>
                            em <%= service_item[:service_date]&.strftime("%d/%m/%Y") || "data a definir" %>
                            (<%= service_item[:quantity] %>x) -
                            <%= number_to_currency(service_item[:total], unit: 'R$ ', separator: ',', delimiter: '.') %>
                          </li>
                        <% end %>
                      </ul>
                    <% else %>
                      Nenhum serviço adicional contratado nesta reserva.
                    <% end %>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>Total de serviços</strong></td>
                  <td><%= number_to_currency(@services_total, unit: 'R$ ', separator: ',', delimiter: '.') %></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>Total pago</strong></td>
                  <td><%= number_to_currency(@total_paid, unit: 'R$ ', separator: ',', delimiter: '.') %></td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <p class="cta-button">
                <a href="<%= @url %>">Ver resumo da reserva</a>
              </p>

              <p>Se ainda não falou com nossa equipe pelo WhatsApp, entre em contato informando o código da reserva.</p>
              <p>Atenciosamente,<br>Equipe Villaggio Girotto</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="footer">
              <p>&copy; <%= Date.current.year %> Villaggio Girotto. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
